<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>AUV hydrodynamic analysis — {{ run_id }}</title>
<style>
body{font:15px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif;color:#172033;max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px;background:#f7f9fc}h1,h2,h3{color:#102a43}section{background:white;padding:22px;margin:18px 0;border:1px solid #d9e2ec;border-radius:10px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px}th,td{border:1px solid #bcccdc;padding:6px;text-align:right}th:first-child,td:first-child{text-align:left}img{max-width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid #d9e2ec;border-radius:6px;margin:8px 0}.notice{padding:12px;background:#fff7d6;border-left:5px solid #d69e2e}.accepted{color:#147d3f}.rejected{color:#b42318}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(420px,1fr));gap:12px}.meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:8px}.meta div{padding:8px;background:#f2f6fa}</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>AUV hydrodynamic analysis</h1>
<p><code>{{ run_id }}</code> — <strong class="{{ status }}">{{ status }}</strong></p>
<p class="notice">This is a smooth, fully turbulent, fixed-hull URANS prediction and has not been validated against experiments.</p>
<section><h2>Configuration and geometry</h2><div class="meta">
<div>Design<br><strong>{{ geometry.source.name }}</strong></div><div>Model<br><strong>{{ model_label }}</strong></div><div>OpenFOAM<br><strong>{{ runtime.version }} / {{ runtime.build }}</strong></div><div>Depth<br><strong>{{ "%.3f"|format(depth_m) }} m</strong></div><div>Seawater density<br><strong>{{ "%.3f"|format(density) }} kg/m³</strong></div><div>Bow<br><strong>{{ geometry.bow_original_axis }} ({{ "%.3f"|format(geometry.bow_confidence) }})</strong></div>
</div><p>Length {{ "%.6f"|format(geometry.length_m) }} m; width {{ "%.6f"|format(geometry.normalized_extents_m[1]) }} m; height {{ "%.6f"|format(geometry.normalized_extents_m[2]) }} m; frontal area {{ "%.9f"|format(geometry.frontal_area_m2) }} m²; wetted area {{ "%.9f"|format(geometry.wetted_area_m2) }} m²; volume {{ "%.9f"|format(geometry.volume_m3) }} m³.</p><img src="{{ geometry_preview }}" alt="Geometry orientation"></section>
<section><h2>Mesh and reference-grid qualification</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Grid</th><th>Cells</th><th>Hull faces</th><th>Layers</th><th>Max non-ortho</th><th>Max skew</th><th>All-geometry determinant (diagnostic)</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for mesh in meshes %}<tr><td>{{ mesh.profile.value }}</td><td>{{ mesh.cell_count }}</td><td>{{ mesh.surface_face_count }}</td><td>{{ "%.2f"|format(mesh.layer_coverage_fraction*100) }}%</td><td>{{ "%.4f"|format(mesh.max_non_orthogonality) }}</td><td>{{ "%.4f"|format(mesh.max_skewness) }}</td><td>{{ "%.6g"|format(mesh.diagnostic_min_wellposedness_determinant) }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table><p>The all-geometry determinant is reported for diagnosis only; OpenFOAM documents this mode as including non-finite-volume-specific checks. CFD mesh acceptance uses checkMesh -meshQuality.</p><p>At 1.00 m/s only: <strong>{{ grid.classification }}</strong>; p={{ grid.observed_order }}; fine GCI={{ grid.fine_gci_percent }}%; accepted={{ grid.accepted }}. {{ grid.reason }}</p><img src="{{ summary_plots.mesh_grid }}" alt="Mesh and grid qualification"></section>
<section><h2>Speed sweep</h2><table><thead><tr><th>m/s</th><th>Re</th><th>Drag N</th><th>Pressure N</th><th>Viscous N</th><th>Cd</th><th>Power W</th><th>y+ median</th><th>Cavitation margin Pa</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for case in production_cases %}<tr><td>{{ "%.2f"|format(case.speed_m_s) }}</td><td>{{ "%.7g"|format(case.reynolds_number) }}</td><td>{{ "%.8g"|format(case.drag_n) }}</td><td>{{ "%.8g"|format(case.force_pressure_n[0]) }}</td><td>{{ "%.8g"|format(case.force_viscous_n[0]) }}</td><td>{{ "%.8g"|format(case.drag_coefficient) }}</td><td>{{ "%.8g"|format(case.tow_power_w) }}</td><td>{{ "%.6g"|format(case.yplus.median) }}</td><td>{{ "%.9g"|format(case.cavitation_margin_pa) }}</td><td>{{ "accepted" if case.accepted else case.rejection_code }}</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table><img src="{{ summary_plots.sweep }}" alt="Sweep plots"></section>
<section><h2>Per-case evidence</h2>{% for item in case_artifacts %}<h3>{{ item.case.mesh_profile.value }} — {{ "%.2f"|format(item.case.speed_m_s) }} m/s</h3><p><a href="{{ item.diagnostics_plot }}">Numerical histories</a> · <a href="{{ item.case_marker }}">case.foam</a> · <a href="{{ item.hull_vtk }}">hull VTK</a> · <a href="{{ item.plane_vtk }}">plane VTK</a></p><div class="gallery">{% if item.cp_png %}<img src="{{ item.cp_png }}" alt="Cp">{% endif %}{% if item.wall_shear_png %}<img src="{{ item.wall_shear_png }}" alt="Wall shear">{% endif %}{% if item.yplus_png %}<img src="{{ item.yplus_png }}" alt="y+">{% endif %}{% if item.flow_png %}<img src="{{ item.flow_png }}" alt="Longitudinal flow">{% endif %}</div>{% if item.warnings %}<p>Warnings: {{ item.warnings|join(", ") }}</p>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</section>
<section><h2>Scope and reproducibility</h2><p>Fixed hull, 0° pitch/yaw, single-phase transient incompressible SST k-omega URANS, smooth wall functions, autocorrelation-aware time-mean drag. Excluded: free surface, appendages, propulsion, control surfaces, roughness, transition, manoeuvring, multiphase cavitation, and experimental validation.</p><p>Configuration <code>{{ configuration.digest }}</code>; <a href="{{ manifest_path }}">manifest</a>; <a href="{{ grid_path }}">grid study</a>.</p></section>
</body></html>
